    "https://www.vacancies.st-andrews.ac.uk/Vacancies/W/5439/0/475346/889/early-years-practitioner-mc1238": {
      "title": "Early Years Practitioner",
      "description": "Early Years Practitioner - MC1238 Register Login Back to search results Early Years Practitioner - MC1238 This post is open to\ncurrent employees of the University only At the University of St Andrews\nNursery, an exciting opportunity has arisen to join our dedicated and caring\nteam. The University of St Andrews Nursery is seeking to recruit one Qualified\nEarly Years Practitioner (EYP). We are looking for a highly\nmotivated, enthusiastic, and creative individual who is committed to delivering\nhigh-quality early learning and childcare. The successful candidate will\ncontribute to the development and wellbeing of our nursery children by creating\na nurturing, stimulating, and inclusive environment. At the University Nursery we\noffer our children a wide range of experiences and opportunities that will help\nthem develop and flourish as they learn new skills through the play experience.\nThe role of the EYP and wider Nursery staff will be to ensure a child centred\napproach in all aspects of the nursery. The EPYs will facilitate such\nopportunities and experience which will enables our children to make decisions\nand solve problems. In addition to the excellent\nworking environment and training opportunities, we have a great range of\nbenefits including: SSSC Fee Covered PVG Update/Join fees covered 4 day week (compressed hours) Free Gym Membership to Saints Sport Staff Uniform 10% Discount on Saint Nursery Childcare 50% Staff discount on Junior Saints Holiday\n    Camps 15% Staff Discount on Weekly Junior Saints\n    Classes Sickness Absence Support and occupational\n    sickness pay. Access to Fife Council Training Annual leave of 30 days, plus 5 public holidays Membership of the S&LAS Pension Scheme with\n    generous employer contributions Staff discount scheme for local and national\n    goods and services Free staff parking, employee Carshare and Cycle\n    to Work Schemes and subsidised local bus travel Subsidised sports membership, reduced tuition\n    fees on degree programmes for staff, access to training and development\n    opportunities including LinkedIn Learning, access to library facilities, salary\n    sacrifice scheme The appointment will be subject\nto a Clear PVG Check for working with children, initiated by the University. * While the role is paid on the\nUniversity’s grade 2 salary scale (£25,353 per annum, £13.45 per hour) pro rata\ndue to current market conditions, a supplement of 15% will be added bringing\nthe overall annual salary to £29,156 pro rata which equates to an hourly rate\nof £15.46.  The market supplement is subject to review with the\nUniversity’s recognized Trade Unions, and if a decision is taken to remove or\nreduce the supplement, full consultation will take place before this is\nimplemented. Further information and informal\nenquiries may be directed to Anja Copland, Nursery Manager email: ac445@st-andrews.ac.uk,\nTel: 01334 46 2121. At St Andrews, equality,\ndiversity, and inclusion are central to who we are and form a core pillar of\nour University Strategy. We are committed to creating a fair, inclusive and\nsupportive workplace, reflected in our participation in national diversity charters\nand awards, including Athena Swan, Carer Positive and the Race Equality\nCharter.\n \nWe particularly welcome\napplications from people from Black, Asian, minority ethnic and minority\nreligions backgrounds and from LGBTQ+ and disabled people. This role is not eligible for\nvisa sponsorship.  Information on other visa options is available at https://www.gov.uk/check-uk-visa or\nby contacting our HR Immigration Team on hrimmigration@st-andrews.ac.uk. Closing Date: 20 October 2026 Please quote ref: MC1238LS Job Description: MC1238LSFPs.pdf Saints Sport Salary: £25,353 per annum plus a 15% Market Supplement will be added Start Date: As soon as possible Apply now Back to search results Early Years Practitioner - MC1238 School/Unit: Saints Sport Posted: 06/10/2026 Closing date: 20/10/2026 Closing time: 23:59 (BST) Apply now Save Share Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Email Address: New Password: At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm Password: Update Password Your login attempt was not successful. Please try again Please select Dr Miss Mr Mrs Ms Other Professor Reverend Reverend DR Sir Dr. des. Assistant Professor Mx Title * First name * Last name * Email address * Password * At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm password * I have read and understood the terms and conditions I have read and understood the data protection statement Create Account Cancel An email has been sent to your email address. Please confirm that your email address is active by clicking the link in the email. Powered by engage|ats Havas People a Havas Company This site is protected by reCAPTCHA. Contact Us - Application Query Terms and Conditions About Privacy Policy Cookies Accessibility FAQs By clicking “Accept All Cookies”, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts. View our privacy policy Cookies Settings Reject All Accept All Cookies Privacy Preference Center When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information might be about you, your preferences or your device and is mostly used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually directly identify you, but it can give you a more personalized web experience. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. Click on the different category headings to find out more and change our default settings. However, blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. Allow All Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Services Always Active These Services are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or filling in forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work. Functional Services Functional Services With these services, the website is able to provide advanced functionality and personalization. They may be set by us or by third parties whose services we use on our sites. If you do not allow these services, this website may not function properly. Back Button Cookie List Search Icon Filter Icon Clear checkbox label label Apply Cancel Consent Leg.Interest checkbox label label checkbox label label checkbox label label Reject All Confirm My Choices 1 Technical Support Today New Messages Technical Support Chatbot (with creds) a few seconds ago Welcome to Technical Support. Please could you let us know whether you're a candidate or a recruiter? Candidate Recruiter ⚡ by Freshworks 1"
