    "https://www.vacancies.st-andrews.ac.uk/Vacancies/W/2551/0/474071/889/house-service-supervisor-rm7345": {
      "title": "House Service Supervisor",
      "description": "House Service Supervisor - RM7345 Register Login Back to search results House Service Supervisor - RM7345 Residential and Business Services are looking\nto recruit a House Service Supervisor to join their team at David Russell\nApartments. The role holder will be responsible for the\nallocation of keys, housekeeping duties, issuing/ordering and stock control of\nhousekeeping materials, responsible for associated housekeeping administration\ntasks, participation in planning for student arrival/departures and summer turn\naround. The role holder will be organised, flexible, have excellent\ncommunication skills, have a customer focused attitude and a friendly\napproachable disposition. We are looking for someone who shows a\ncommitment to an excellent level of customer care and would enjoy working and\nleading staff in our small team. If you have a can-do attitude, want to make a\ndifference, and enjoy working with a diverse range of people then this may be\nthe role for you. This\nis a permanent post, Term Time (36 weeks) 30 hours per week, and Summer (16\nweeks) 36.25 hours per week on a 52 week contract and a 5 day from 7 basis. Experience\npreferred but not essential as full training will be provided.\n \nFurther information and informal enquiries may be directed to Dionne\nHenderson, drareception@st-andrews.ac.uk , Tel: 01334 467100. At St Andrews, equality, diversity, and inclusion are central to who we\nare and form a core pillar of our University Strategy. We are committed to\ncreating a fair, inclusive and supportive workplace, reflected in our\nparticipation in national diversity charters and awards, including Athena Swan,\nCarer Positive and the Race Equality Charter. \nWe particularly welcome applications from people from Black, Asian,\nminority ethnic and minority religions backgrounds and from LGBTQ+ and disabled\npeople. This role is not eligible for visa sponsorship.  Information on\nother visa options is available at https://www.gov.uk/check-uk-visa or by contacting our HR Immigration Team on hrimmigration@st-andrews.ac.uk. Job Description: RM7345RH FP's.pdf Closing Date: 21 October 2026 Interview Date: 3 November 2026 Residential and Business Services Salary: £25,353 per annum pro rata Hours: 30 hours per week (Term time)           36.25 hours per week (Summer) Apply now Back to search results House Service Supervisor - RM7345 School/Unit: Residential and Business Services Posted: 09/09/2026 Closing date: 21/10/2026 Closing time: 23:59 (BST) Apply now Save Share Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Email Address: New Password: At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm Password: Update Password Your login attempt was not successful. Please try again Please select Dr Miss Mr Mrs Ms Other Professor Reverend Reverend DR Sir Dr. des. Assistant Professor Mx Title * First name * Last name * Email address * Password * At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm password * I have read and understood the terms and conditions I have read and understood the data protection statement Create Account Cancel An email has been sent to your email address. Please confirm that your email address is active by clicking the link in the email. Powered by engage|ats Havas People a Havas Company This site is protected by reCAPTCHA. Contact Us - Application Query Terms and Conditions About Privacy Policy Cookies Accessibility FAQs By clicking “Accept All Cookies”, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts. View our privacy policy Cookies Settings Reject All Ac